linuxdeploy-plugin-gtk.sh is from the Tauri repository at commit
548a3692f59405aeb239c5b63fa589824eee51e8, under MIT OR Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/blob/548a3692f59405aeb239c5b63fa589824eee51e8/crates/tauri-bundler/src/bundle/linux/appimage/linuxdeploy-plugin-gtk.sh

The build script copies the plugin and disables its broad WebKit /usr rewrite;
it relocates only WebKit's helper directory separately.
